@branchId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### App: list branches
GET {{host}}/app/branches
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### App: get branch by id
GET {{host}}/app/branches/{{branchId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard: create branch
POST {{host}}/dashboard/branches
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Downtown",
  "location": "123 Main St"
}

### Dashboard: list branches
GET {{host}}/dashboard/branches
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard: get branch by id
GET {{host}}/dashboard/branches/{{branchId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard: update branch
PATCH {{host}}/dashboard/branches/{{branchId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Downtown West",
  "location": "456 Oak Ave"
}

### Dashboard: delete branch
DELETE {{host}}/dashboard/branches/{{branchId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
